This project is an independent implementation of a file-based memory system for
the Pi coding agent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
Anthropic, PBC or the Pi project maintainers.

Scope of the source code
  All source code in this repository was written for this project. No source
  code, build output, or prompt text from another product is included.

Reference analysis
  docs/claude-code-memory-pipeline.md is an independent behavioral analysis of a
  separately obtained codebase, kept as design input. It contains architectural
  observations and internal identifiers, not copied source code, and is not part
  of the runtime implementation.

No warranty
  This software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. It is at the
  M1 stage: lifecycle behavior such as prompt injection, compaction and live
  model recall has not been verified in a real Pi session. Review memory content
  and paths before relying on it in sensitive repositories.

Third-party components
  Runtime dependencies are resolved through the Pi host. See package.json for the
  declared peer dependencies and LICENSE for the license of this project.
